It looks like a Mario Kart with a children’s storybook art style. Teddy Floppy Ear’s – The Race is a single player or two players with local split screen racing game with European inspired old vehicles. It's a limited race game but its what you get for buying a kids game.
Pros: 	- Looks great for a kids race game;
- Catching race musics;
- Nice race tracks.
Cons:	- No kart stats;
- No pilots stats;
- No challenging I.A.;
- Few weapons to choose;
- Few Racetracks.
7,5/10.

