Finished the game, loved it and I'm expecting for a sequel already!
PROS:
+ Awesome combos, both gorund-level and aerial;
+ Interesting story and lore;
+ A recall of an incredible Action-RPG Platformer, Castlevania: Symphony of the Nights, in a whole original way of its own;
+ Beautiful scenarios;
+ Challenging gameplay;
+ More than one way to solve some extra puzzles.
CONS:
- The game is a bit short, roughly 20~30 hours to complete all extra challenges;
- I understand being an Action-RPG, it's focused on ACTION, but I'd have loved it to have focused a bit more into character development and interaction as well.
A "must-have" for Action-RPG lovers such as myself!

